    "description": "This library converts config files between \u2013 YAML, JSON and Windows INI file format. For example, supervisord uses INI file format. Using the gem you can configure supervisord via a YAML file, and generate INI as needed. DuperVisor installs `dv`  CLI converter. Run `dv -h` for help.",
